                                    <div class="flex justify-between"><span class="font-semibold">Quesadillas</span><span class="text-green-600 font-bold">$8.50</span></div>
                                    <div class="text-sm text-gray-600">Flour or corn tortilla stuffed with cheese & choice of meat</div>
                                </div>
                                <div>
                                    <div class="flex justify-between"><span class="font-semibold">Huarache</span><span class="text-green-600 font-bold">$10.00</span></div>
                                    <div class="text-sm text-gray-600">Thick oval hand made tortilla topped with beans, choice of meat, lettuce, sour cream and cotija cheese</div>
                                </div>
                                <div>
                                    <div class="flex justify-between"><span class="font-semibold">Burritos</span><span class="text-green-600 font-bold">$10.00</span></div>
                                    <div class="text-sm text-gray-600">Steamed flour tortilla w/ rice, beans, meat of choice, sour cream, lettuce, cheese, salsa on the side</div>
